	<!-- Files the app reads (views/file_open/file_kind.dart names the same
	     extensions). The exported declarations teach the OS the Ham2K types
	     exist at all; ADIF is imported, since the format is not ours; the
	     document types are what make Files and Finder offer this app. A file
	     opened that way still only reaches Flutter because AppDelegate
	     implements application(_:open:) — app_links handles URL schemes only.
